{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"the mender takes a long considering look \"So you call someone master that tells you nothing of themselves?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:21:27.191000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868165928892903434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"He aint done no wrong far as i kin see.\" He stares off a moment. \"He offered to teach me how ta stop my friends from dying. Given what i saw the other night... It'll come in handy I reckon.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:23:39.456000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868166483652513822","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"have you ever had dealings with devils before?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:24:02.932000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868166582118002709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I trust devils over the machines I saw in statten.\" His face calms.","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:25:14.733000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868166883273232464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Oh...\" He pauses another moment. \"Last night, saw another of those moth things.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:28:31.637000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868167709148450856","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he shakes his head \"why trust either?  I have been in the great war for centuries.... Angels... Demons.... The Heavens versus the Hells.... lifetimes of war...\" he pauses and you realize he is straightening up, like there was a weight on his shoulders he is trying to bear \"I have seen many devils corrupt many good souls... and its through thoughtful promises the most effective ones succeed... That man has the same feel, the same atmosphere... as the ones that will get your soul as a price... and you wont even know you have given it....\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:30:01.550000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868168086270931014","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I had hopes you would be able to join my path..... but you have set forth on another.... with a man you know nothing of.... promising you candies.... but all you will find is angry kelp... good luck to you bo....\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:31:43.958000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868168515801214976","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
