{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Ah, Mender - Fuddles is on her way to talk to you, Kukudh says. If you need some rest first, I can pass on the message, though.'","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:33:06.072000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868168860212277258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Sounds like a question you need to ask yourself\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:34:05.961000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868169111404949534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Each day, friends die... This place... \" he stutters. \"I aint got the power to save'em.\" He takes a few steps closer. \"I know of the crows, I know there are other ways to come back... All with a price.","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:34:27.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868169199686672405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he looks at Sabrine \"I have had more rest that I should need\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:34:32.366000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868169222155554898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"what price are you paying to that demon of a man?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:34:55.407000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868169318796492860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she nods. 'Rest, just time to gather thoughts, whatever you need.'","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:35:07.262000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868169368519983124","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"If i kin halt others from even dealing with those ways, its a cost I'll happily take.\" He smiles. \"He aint asked me none of no price yet, but I trust him. He aint done me no wrong.\" Bo trails off a moment. \"I was powerless to Do anything about a jackalope in a red cloak last night that tried to murder us in the basement of the umbral cup, I was powerless to stop those... Machines amassing in statten island the night before.\" He stops, staring at the pool.","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:38:13.200000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868170148400496700","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"what if I told you I had the power to end this war here and now?  Should I do that for you and leave.... or let you fight your own battles.\"  he raises his hands up \"I can control the winds and weather, calling down hail and lightning at will\" storms clouds gather overhead \"I could lance every ship the redcoats have.\" he puts his hands on the ground \"I can awaken every blade of grass, every tree and shrub to defend its terrain\" the grass grows a foot tall, the trees stir, the park is alive \"what could soldiers do to any grove I go to?\"  He stands up and you notice the rover nearby growing to a story tall \"I can call upon bodies of water the flood entire cities.....\" and then he fixates on Bo, as everyone starts feeling lighter \"I can even reverse gravity's pull.\" and with a motion it all ends \"So the question I have for you, is it my place to solve everyone else's problem... or should I leave them free to live fir themselves\" (and yes I have spells for all those effects)","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:44:35.256000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868171750859493397","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Thinking others too weak to take care of themselves is you not having faith in them\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:45:08.137000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868171888772407347","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Sabrine looks slightly panicked.","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:45:16.521000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868171923937460236","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I trust in you all to stand up for what you believe in... or die trying.... and if you fall.... I will do what I can to bring you ll back..... but It's not my place to call others too weak to have the free will to try.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T16:46:46.282000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868172300422377513","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
